  "articleBody": "A bedroom addition can create needed sleeping space, but the right plan depends on lot dimensions, setbacks, foundation conditions, ceiling height, windows, insulation, electrical work, and whether the room will include a closet, bathroom, or separate entrance. A coordinated design-and-construction plan helps identify permit needs and construction impacts before work begins.",
